{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889160/extras/9eaa38b989f9c038c5882b882bd6fce6.poster.avif?t=1580228049\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889160/extras/9eaa38b989f9c038c5882b882bd6fce6.webm?t=1580228049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889160/extras/9eaa38b989f9c038c5882b882bd6fce6.mp4?t=1580228049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>ULTIRE: Balls Out</strong> is an action-packed game that is easy to pick up, but requires great precision and decision-making skills to master. Control your ball, collect pickups and avoid obstacles as you compete in different <strong>game modes: </strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Elimination Arena</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A multiplayer game mode that has up to 8 players packed into the same arena.<br></li><li>Avoid being thrown off platforms by all costs \u2014 last ball &quot;alive&quot; wins.<br></li><li>Stay active! Different pickups will spawn during the round \u2014 camping only hurts your chances to win.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Singleplayer Race</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A singleplayer mode where you need to collect all checkpoints to beat the map in the lowest time possible.<br></li><li>Fight to shave milliseconds off your time by avoiding tiny mistakes \u2014 they matter a whole lot!<br></li><li>See where you rank amongst your friends and players from all over the world on the Leaderboards.</li></ul><br>You can also customize your ball by using BallCoins that you earn just by playing the game!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"644eca9997613e6cf5e0d9697de2786d16dc7e9c.jpg","localized_name":"Elimination Arena Winner","name":"Elimination Arena Winner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunit